[statement]
A package is triggered when a package its condition names is placed, if
the condition holds in what is installed, though another package it names
is still being walked: `ext` follows `a`, before `top`, which it also
names.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1

P:b
V:1

P:ext
V:1
i:a top

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install ext 1
install b 1
install top 1
